# Governance

- Read `docs/AGENT_AUTHORITY.md` and `docs/CURRENT_STATE.md` before changing
  this repository.
- Stay within the assigned phase and role. Do not convert research tasks into
  implementation.
- Preserve existing valid work. Make assumptions explicit and record unknowns
  rather than inventing facts.
- Record durable architectural decisions as ADRs using
  `docs/adr/ADR-TEMPLATE.md`.
- Update `docs/ENGINEERING_JOURNAL.md` and `docs/CURRENT_STATE.md` when a change
  alters evidence, decisions, risks, or readiness.
- Do not commit generated data, secrets, credentials, tokens, account
  identifiers, or personal information.
- Claims must cite reproducible evidence. Clearly label proposals,
  assumptions, and unverified findings.
